Package: ovios-pve-storage
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager, libpve-storage-perl, perl, openssh-client
Maintainer: OviOS <ovi@ovios.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/ksovi/proxmox-agent
Description: OviOS iSCSI provider for Proxmox VE ZFS over iSCSI
 Adds OviOS Linux as an iSCSI provider to the Proxmox VE "ZFS over iSCSI"
 storage type, so VM disks can be created, resized and deleted as zvols on an
 OviOS storage appliance. The package registers the provider in ZFSPlugin.pm
 and the web UI, and re-applies those edits automatically whenever a Proxmox
 upgrade replaces the files.
